#: ../../legacy/cmucam4/autonomous-vehicle-control.rst:5
msgid "Abstract"
msgstr "Abstrak"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam4/autonomous-vehicle-control.rst:7
msgid ""
"An autonomous vehicle is one that is able to operate independently of human "
"control through feedback returned by various sensors. These vehicles are "
"often used to reduce problems, risks and costs that arise from human "
"involvement. The goal of this project is to design and program a convoy in "
"which autonomous vehicles follows a human controlled lead car. In order to "
"develop this system of vehicles, multiple sensors have to be used to keep "
"the convoy together. Standard radio controlled cars are used as the vehicles"
" in the system and were equipped with Arduino microcontrollers, the CMUcam4 "
"camera for color tracking as well as the Parallax Ping))) ultrasonic sensor."
" Servos are also mounted on the vehicles in order to allow the camera and "
"ping to turn according to the lead car. Using these sensors, the distance "
"between the vehicles is used to determine the motor speed, while the input "
"from the CMUcam4 allows the vehicles to follow the ones ahead when they "
"turn. These sensors continuously return data, allowing for the following "
"cars to adjust to any changes in the system."
msgstr ""
"Kendaraan otonom adalah kendaraan yang mampu beroperasi secara independen "
"dari kontrol manusia melalui umpan balik yang dikembalikan oleh berbagai "
"sensor. Kendaraan-kendaraan ini sering digunakan untuk mengurangi masalah, "
"risiko, dan biaya yang timbul dari keterlibatan manusia. Tujuan proyek ini "
"adalah merancang dan memprogram konvoi di mana kendaraan otonom mengikuti "
"mobil pemimpin yang dikendalikan manusia. Untuk mengembangkan sistem "
"kendaraan ini, beberapa sensor harus digunakan untuk menjaga konvoi tetap "
"bersama. Mobil kendali radio standar digunakan sebagai kendaraan dalam "
"sistem dan dilengkapi dengan mikrokontroler Arduino, kamera CMUcam4 untuk "
"pelacakan warna serta sensor ultrasonik Parallax Ping))). Servo juga "
"dipasang pada kendaraan untuk memungkinkan kamera dan ping berputar sesuai "
"dengan mobil pemimpin. Menggunakan sensor-sensor ini, jarak antar kendaraan "
"digunakan untuk menentukan kecepatan motor, sementara input dari CMUcam4 "
"memungkinkan kendaraan mengikuti kendaraan di depannya saat mereka berbelok."
" Sensor-sensor ini terus mengembalikan data, memungkinkan mobil-mobil "
"pengikut menyesuaikan diri dengan setiap perubahan dalam sistem."

